    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BlockArtist is a creative game that combines physics construction and puzzle solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can restore more model drawings within the building area by picking and placing building blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can challenge multi-layered stacking and structural balance, unlocking imaginative levels. From simple geometric shapes to complex 3D architecture, you will unleash your creativity in limited space, conquering every challenge with logic and technique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently offers three modes: single player, battle, and cooperative: you can challenge levels alone and pursue shorter setup time. You can also engage in 1v1 battles with friends to see who builds faster. Couples can also collaborate to overcome challenges together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our world of building blocks with your friends!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BlockArtist is a creative game that combines physics construction and puzzle solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can restore more model drawings within the building area by picking and placing building blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can challenge multi-layered stacking and structural balance, unlocking imaginative levels. From simple geometric shapes to complex 3D architecture, you will unleash your creativity in limited space, conquering every challenge with logic and technique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently offers three modes: single player, battle, and cooperative: you can challenge levels alone and pursue shorter setup time. You can also engage in 1v1 battles with friends to see who builds faster. Couples can also collaborate to overcome challenges together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our world of building blocks with your friends!</p>",
